```
## Refactoring: [Title]

### Code smell
What the problem is and why it matters (metrics: line count, coupling, etc.).

### Pre-conditions
- Current test coverage: X%
- Tests to add before refactoring: [list]

### Plan
1. [Step] -- test gate: [which tests confirm correctness]
2. [Step] -- test gate: [...]
...

### Risk assessment
- Breaking change: yes/no
- Files affected: N
- Estimated steps: N
- Rollback strategy: [how to undo if needed]
```
